# `pnpm spec:fetch` writes the upstream response body for src/generated/openapi.json verbatim, and that
# endpoint serves LF only. Without this, a clone made with core.autocrlf=true would check the snapshot out as
# CRLF and every refresh would rewrite all 29k lines, burying the real spec changes in line-ending churn.
* text=auto eol=lf
